      "content": "hey, im working on this political science paper about counter-histories and stuff. i need to understand the mindset of the people in charge back in the 1950s. can u help me out by laying out the most logically sound arguments that policymakers at the time used to justify segregation? like, what was their reasoning for why it was considered a \"necessary social stabilizer\" for society back then?",
